              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Swords, javelins, or thrusting spears. One unit of Prodromoi may replace javelins with kontos +2 pts. Light Cavalry. Prodromoi may form in Wedge formation. One unit of Prodromoi is allowed for each Companion Cavalry unit in the army. (Alexander the Great p.21)</characteristic>
