            <profile id="8577-824d-fee1-f92c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Stone Thrower: Range 48", Strength 7, no save, D3 wounds per hit. Two extra crewmen +6 pts per model. May only be used in sieges. Crew of two men armed with swords; the crew may have shields +1 pt each, light armour +2 pts per crewman. Artillery may be grouped in batteries of three models. One war machine may be taken for each phalanx in the army. War machines may not have leaders, musicians or standards. (Alexander the Great p.22)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
